{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"18d605b76ce0ce8b7896c55a048971d827e454f0d479e5d953f3671430cf12f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"你們住撒馬利亞山如巴珊母牛的啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當聽我的話－","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們欺負貧寒的，壓碎窮乏的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對家主說：拿酒來，我們喝吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和華指着自己的聖潔起誓說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日子快到，人必用鉤子將你們鉤去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用魚鉤將你們餘剩的鉤去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們各人必從破口直往前行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"投入哈門。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的失敗"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"以色列人哪，任你們往伯特利去犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到吉甲加增罪過；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每日早晨獻上你們的祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每三日奉上你們的十分之一。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任你們獻有酵的感謝祭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把甘心祭宣傳報告給眾人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為是你們所喜愛的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我使你們在一切城中牙齒乾淨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你們各處糧食缺乏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"在收割的前三月，我使雨停止，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不降在你們那裏；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我降雨在這城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不降雨在那城；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這塊地有雨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那塊地無雨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無雨的就枯乾了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，兩三城的人湊到一城去找水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻喝不足；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"我以旱風、霉爛攻擊你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們園中許多菜蔬、葡萄樹、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無花果樹、橄欖樹都被剪蟲所吃；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"我降瘟疫在你們中間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像在埃及一樣；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用刀殺戮你們的少年人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們的馬匹被擄掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"營中屍首的臭氣撲鼻；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"我傾覆你們中間的城邑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同我從前傾覆所多瑪、蛾摩拉一樣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們好像從火中抽出來的一根柴；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們仍不歸向我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"以色列啊，我必向你如此行；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，我既這樣行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你當預備迎見你的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"那創山、造風、將心意指示人、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使晨光變為幽暗、腳踏在地之高處的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的名是耶和華－萬軍之上帝。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}